            "comprehends": [
             "copies/qp421cd7297#inscription"
            ],
            "note": "Graded high on the figures of the date: every figure is plain. Pencil, six figures run together with no separators; read from the lower (180-degree) panel. Figures 1, 2 and 5 each end in a horizontal base stroke and are 2s; figures 3 and 4 are plain slanted strokes, so 11; the last is a clear double-bowled 3."
           }
          ]
         }
        }
       },
       "medium": "pencil"
      }
     ]
    }
